@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 200 - Class14 overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 200 - All projects, ordered by title then slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects

### 200 - Search and exact topic filter (AND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?q=react&topic=React

### 200 - Case insensitive topic
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?topic=mysql

### 200 - Whitespace trimmed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?q=%20react%20&topic=%20React%20

### 200 - Empty filter means no filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?q=%20&topic=%20

### 200 - No results for an unknown topic
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?topic=missing

### 200 - Topic matches the whole tag, not a substring
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?topic=Reac

### 200 - Percent is literal, not a SQL wildcard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?q=%25

### 200 - Underscore is literal, not a SQL wildcard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?q=_

### 200 - Project with students, Markdown, PDFs and resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/express-blog-sql

### 200 - Slug lookup is case insensitive
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/REACT-HELLO-WORLD

### 400 - Invalid slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/bad_slug

### 400 - Detail does not accept queries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/react-api?q=react

### 400 - Unknown query parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?limit=1

### 400 - Repeated query parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?q=react&q=mysql

### 400 - Structured query parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?q[]=react

### 400 - A single topic is required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?topic=React,MySQL

### 400 - Control character
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?q=%00

### 400 - Malformed path encoding
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/%E0%A4%A

### 404 - Project does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/nonexistent

### 404 - Unknown API route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/missing

### 500 - Error test route (no internal details in response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/errors
